<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch June balance of trade data postponed.</title>
<headline>Dutch June balance of trade data postponed.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said Dutch June balance of trade data would not be published on Friday morning, as had been scheduled, because of technical problems.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
